Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:09.65,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,You join me in what is undoubtedly the hottest room in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:13.98,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,Sponsored feature It's got lots of glass, bi-fold doors, lovely roof lantern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:16.78,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,And for the winter and the spring and the autumn,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:18.35,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,it's a lovely room to be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:21.10,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,But once that sun gets up in the height of the summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.83,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,you just can't be in here. It's like a greenhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:25.62,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,And if you've got a space like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:28.04,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,either a garden room or it could be a bedroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:31.68,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,loft room or any other room in the house that gets unbearably hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.46,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,you'll know exactly what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.95,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,So when people talk about portable air conditioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:40.28,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,I'ma bit skeptical because a lot of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:42.02,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,ones I've seen are a bit clunky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:45.42,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,they're a bit noisy and they're not really that effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:48.18,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,But this one from Midea is different
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:50.92,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,because it's actually a PortaSplit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.85,Default,Character 1,0,0,0,,It's a split unit but you can move it around.
